      "side": 1,
      "message": "This headline undersells the change. I think the version numbers should be included, for example:\n\n`Add support for OpenROADM 13.1.1 and 17.1.0 models`\n\nI wonder whether it would make sense to split the 13.1.1 and 17.1 models into separate revisions and Gerrit changes (commits). As it stands, mixing changes for both versions into a single revision can make it difficult to tell which changes belong to which version.\n\nSince this is still a work in progress, I imagine more changes may be added, making it even harder to distinguish between the two versions.",
      "revId": "19a8959a728386e5ef15b57e84424a00f00e8a3c",
